UnitRegistryIcm
├── when reading the chain ID of a key
│   ├── given the entry has a chain ID
│   │   └── it returns it
│   └── given the entry has no chain ID
│       └── it reverts with EntryNotFound naming the key and chainId
├── when reading the ICM blockchain ID
│   ├── given the entry has one
│   │   └── it returns the bytes32
│   └── given the entry has none
│       └── it reverts with EntryNotFound naming icm blockchainId
├── when reading an ICM transferrer
│   ├── given the entry has the transferrer
│   │   └── it returns the address
│   └── given the entry has none
│       └── it reverts with EntryNotFound naming the transferrer
└── when reading a selector from an explicit directory
    └── it returns the selector of that directory
